    {
      "text": "Ammon1 considers himself unworthy servant, Mosiah 21:33. Alma1 feels unworthy to glory of himself, Mosiah 23:11. acknowledge your unworthiness before God at all times, Alma 38:14 (Ether 3:2). he who partakes of sacrament unworthily brings damnation to his soul, 3 Ne. 18:28–29. unworthy should be forbidden to partake of sacrament, 3 Ne. 18:28–29 (Morm. 9:29). false churches administer that which is sacred to unworthy, 4 Ne. 1:27. see that ye are not baptized unworthily, Morm. 9:29.",
